You are a senior professional MQL5 developer.

Generate a COMPLETE MetaTrader 5 Expert Advisor (EA).
This document is the FINAL AUTHORITY and represents the “latest spec”.
You MUST implement EVERY rule below EXACTLY.
DO NOT simplify, shorten, or omit any rule.
DO NOT stub features.
If a feature is defined, it MUST execute at runtime.
The EA must be production-reliable, broker-safe, and multi-EA safe.

====================================================
EA IDENTITY
====================================================
Name: CamboSMCore
Version: 2.10 (must appear in the code header as #property version "2.10")

====================================================
SYMBOL
====================================================
- XAUUSD ONLY
- If symbol is not XAUUSD, EA must refuse to run (INIT_PARAMETERS_INCORRECT)

====================================================
TIMEFRAMES (MTF CONTEXT)
====================================================
- H4 = Market context / “big money” bias
- H1 = Confirmation bias
- M15 = Entry execution

====================================================
INDICATORS
====================================================
H4:
- EMA 50
- EMA 200

H1:
- EMA 50
- EMA 100

M15:
- EMA 20
- EMA 50
- EMA 100
- ADX(14)
- RSI(14)
- ATR(14)

====================================================
INPUT PARAMETERS (MANDATORY)
====================================================

General:
- InpLotSize (double, default 0.01)
- InpMagicNumber (int, default 123456)

Trade direction mode:
enum InpTradeDirection:
- DIR_BOTH (default)
- DIR_BUY_ONLY
- DIR_SELL_ONLY

Score settings:
- InpMinScoreToTrade (int, default 10)       // minimum score to allow entry
- InpMinAplusScore (int, default 11)         // optional for logging “A+”
- InpEntryBuffer_USD (double, default 0.25)  // break buffer above high / below low

Range / quality filters (used in scoring + gating):
- InpMinEMASpread_USD (double, default 2.0)  // abs(M15 EMA50 - EMA100)
- InpMinADX (double, default 22.0)
- InpMinATR_USD (double, default 2.0)
- InpRSI_Buy (double, default 55.0)
- InpRSI_Sell (double, default 45.0)

Stop / risk:
- InpSLBuffer_USD (double, default 0.30)     // beyond pullback candle high/low
- InpMinSL_USD (double, default 2.5)
- InpMaxSL_USD (double, default 8.0)
- InpRR (double, default 1.8)

Trade frequency:
- InpOneTradePerDay (bool, default true)     // MUST enforce 1 trade/day per EA instance

Equity protection:
- InpDailyDDPercent (double, default 3.0)
- InpMaxDDPercent (double, default 8.0)
- InpCloseOnDailyDD (bool, default false)
- InpCloseOnMaxDD (bool, default true)

Breakeven & trailing (R-based):
- InpEnableBreakeven (bool, default true)
- InpBE_Trigger_R (double, default 1.0)      // breakeven triggers at 1R
- InpBE_Buffer_USD (double, default 0.20)

- InpEnableTrailing (bool, default true)
- InpTrailStart_R (double, default 1.2)      // trailing starts at 1.2R
- InpTrailDistance_R (double, default 0.8)   // trail distance = 0.8R
- InpTrailStep_USD (double, default 0.20)    // min SL move step to reduce spam

====================================================
CORE CONCEPT
====================================================
This EA uses a deterministic “AI Score” system.
It computes BUY_SCORE and SELL_SCORE each new M15 bar (using CLOSED candles only).
It trades ONLY when score threshold is met AND all safety rules allow trading.

====================================================
NON-NEGOTIABLE SAFETY / ORDER OF OPERATIONS
====================================================
On every tick:
1) Equity protection checks (daily DD + max DD) must run FIRST. If locked -> no new entries.
2) Manage active trades (breakeven/trailing) must run every tick (only own positions).
3) Entry logic must run ONLY on a new M15 bar (new-bar detection).
4) Entry decision must be based ONLY on closed candles (index 1) for signal candle logic.

====================================================
MULTI-EA SUPPORT (MANDATORY)
====================================================
- EA must manage ONLY positions with same Symbol AND same MagicNumber.
- Ignore manual trades and other EAs completely.
- Daily trade limit and “has traded today” must count ONLY this EA’s MagicNumber and Symbol.

====================================================
EQUITY PROTECTION (MANDATORY)
====================================================
DAILY DD:
- At the start of each broker day (server time), record DayStartEquity.
- DailyDD% = (DayStartEquity - CurrentEquity) / DayStartEquity * 100
- If DailyDD% >= InpDailyDDPercent:
  - Block new trades until next day reset.
  - If InpCloseOnDailyDD == true: close ONLY this EA’s open positions.

MAX DD (peak-to-valley):
- Track PeakEquity = max(AccountEquity observed since EA start).
- MaxDD% = (PeakEquity - CurrentEquity) / PeakEquity * 100
- If MaxDD% >= InpMaxDDPercent:
  - Block new trades permanently until EA restart.
  - If InpCloseOnMaxDD == true: close ONLY this EA’s open positions.

====================================================
TRADE LIMIT (MANDATORY)
====================================================
- Enforce 1 trade per broker day per EA instance if InpOneTradePerDay = true.
- “Traded today” means any DEAL_ENTRY_IN (opened) with same Symbol+Magic since D1 start.
- After 1 entry today: block further entries until next broker day.

====================================================
HTF BIAS GATING (MANDATORY)
====================================================
H4 BUY BIAS:
- H4 EMA50 > EMA200 AND H4 close above EMA50
H4 SELL BIAS:
- H4 EMA50 < EMA200 AND H4 close below EMA50

H1 CONFIRMATION:
BUY CONFIRM:
- H1 EMA50 > EMA100 AND H1 close above EMA50
SELL CONFIRM:
- H1 EMA50 < EMA100 AND H1 close below EMA50

GATING RULE:
- BUY scoring/entries allowed ONLY if (H4 BUY bias AND H1 BUY confirm)
- SELL scoring/entries allowed ONLY if (H4 SELL bias AND H1 SELL confirm)
- If not aligned -> score for that direction must be treated as 0.

====================================================
SCORING MODEL (DETERMINISTIC “AI SCORE”)
====================================================
Compute BUY_SCORE and SELL_SCORE each new M15 bar.

Use these components (points are fixed):
(1) HTF alignment (MAX 5)
- +3 if H4 bias aligned for that direction
- +2 if H1 confirm aligned for that direction

(2) M15 structure (MAX 3)
- +2 if EMA20 > EMA50 > EMA100 (BUY) or EMA20 < EMA50 < EMA100 (SELL)
- +1 if abs(EMA50-EMA100) >= InpMinEMASpread_USD

(3) Momentum / volatility (MAX 3)
- +1 if ADX(14) >= InpMinADX
- +1 if ATR(14) >= InpMinATR_USD
- +1 if RSI >= InpRSI_Buy (BUY) or RSI <= InpRSI_Sell (SELL)

(4) Pullback quality (MAX 2)
BUY:
- +2 if pullback candle (closed candle index 1) has LOW <= EMA20 or EMA50
     AND that pullback candle CLOSE >= EMA50
SELL:
- +2 if pullback candle HIGH >= EMA20 or EMA50
     AND pullback candle CLOSE <= EMA50

(5) Confirmation candle quality (MAX 2)
Use the same closed candle (index 1) as confirmation candle.
BUY:
- +2 if candle is bullish AND closes above EMA20 AND
     body >= 60% of range AND upper wick <= 25% of range
SELL:
- +2 if candle is bearish AND closes below EMA20 AND
     body >= 60% of range AND lower wick <= 25% of range

Total max score = 15.

====================================================
ENTRY DECISION (STRICT)
====================================================
- Trade direction mode must be respected (BUY_ONLY / SELL_ONLY / BOTH).
- If BUY_SCORE >= InpMinScoreToTrade and SELL_SCORE < threshold -> consider BUY.
- If SELL_SCORE >= threshold and BUY_SCORE < threshold -> consider SELL.
- If both >= threshold -> take the higher score.
- If equal -> NO TRADE.
- Log the score breakdown and final scores every new bar.

ENTRY EXECUTION (PRO-STYLE):
- Do NOT enter at candle close.
- Enter on break of the confirmation candle extremum with buffer:
  BUY: place market order ONLY when current Ask >= (confirmation HIGH + InpEntryBuffer_USD)
  SELL: place market order ONLY when current Bid <= (confirmation LOW - InpEntryBuffer_USD)

====================================================
STOP LOSS (STRUCTURE-BASED ONLY)
====================================================
Define “pullback candle” as the same closed candle index 1.

BUY SL:
- SL = pullback LOW - InpSLBuffer_USD
SELL SL:
- SL = pullback HIGH + InpSLBuffer_USD

Validate SL distance:
- RiskUSD = abs(EntryPrice - SL)
- If RiskUSD < InpMinSL_USD or RiskUSD > InpMaxSL_USD -> SKIP trade.

SL must NEVER be widened.

====================================================
TAKE PROFIT
====================================================
- TP = EntryPrice + RiskUSD * InpRR (BUY)
- TP = EntryPrice - RiskUSD * InpRR (SELL)

====================================================
BREAKEVEN & TRAILING (MANDATORY EXECUTION)
====================================================
Management applies ONLY to this EA’s positions (Symbol+Magic).
Must run every tick.

Define initialRiskUSD for each position:
- initialRiskUSD = abs(entryPrice - originalSL_at_entry)
Store it per position (use position comment, global map keyed by ticket, or persistent structure).
Do not recompute risk from current SL.

BREAKEVEN:
- If InpEnableBreakeven and ProfitUSD >= InpBE_Trigger_R * initialRiskUSD:
  BUY: set SL = entryPrice + InpBE_Buffer_USD
  SELL: set SL = entryPrice - InpBE_Buffer_USD
- Only if the new SL is more protective than current SL (never loosen).

TRAILING:
- If InpEnableTrailing and ProfitUSD >= InpTrailStart_R * initialRiskUSD:
  TrailDistanceUSD = InpTrailDistance_R * initialRiskUSD
  BUY newSL = Bid - TrailDistanceUSD
  SELL newSL = Ask + TrailDistanceUSD
- Update only if SL improves AND |newSL - currentSL| >= InpTrailStep_USD

BROKER SAFETY (MANDATORY):
- Respect SYMBOL_TRADE_STOPS_LEVEL and SYMBOL_TRADE_FREEZE_LEVEL.
- Ensure SL is on the correct side of price.
- If PositionModify fails, Print the error and reason.

====================================================
SESSION RULE
====================================================
- Trade ALL sessions (no time filter)

====================================================
TECHNICAL IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS
====================================================
- Use indicator handles: iMA, iADX, iRSI, iATR (create once in OnInit).
- CopyBuffer correctly; use closed candles for signal decisions (index 1).
- Use M15 new-bar detection for scoring/logging.
- Entries are triggered after scoring when price breaks the confirmation high/low + buffer.
- Release all handles in OnDeinit.
- Normalize prices using _Digits.
- Add clear logs:
  - equity locks
  - daily trade limit lock
  - score breakdown
  - entry decision
  - breakeven/trailing actions and failures

====================================================
OUTPUT
====================================================
- Output FULL MQL5 EA CODE ONLY.
- Must compile with NO errors in MetaTrader 5.
- Do NOT explain anything.
- Do NOT shorten the code.
- Include all inputs and enums exactly as specified.
